    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties offer this 4- bedroom, detached residence, situated at ‘Kiltannon’, Ballyadam Cross, Carrigtwohill. Built in 1971, this home is set on a generous site and extends to 139 sq. m.  of living accommodation.\r\nThe property provides well-proportioned accommodation over two floors and offers excellent potential in a convenient location. There is also a block-built garage and boiler house attached to the property which is fully powered.\r\nIdeally located at Ballyadam Cross, this home enjoys a semi-rural setting while remaining close to Carrigtwohill and its local amenities, schools and services. The surrounding area provides convenient access to the wider East Cork area and Cork City. \r\nAccommodation; Entrance Hall, Kitchen/Dining Area, Living Room, Sitting Room, Sunroom, Guest w.c, 4 Double Bedrooms & Family Bathroom (Circa 139. Sq. m)\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €380,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:        Entrance hallway featuring parquet flooring, a large window providing plenty of natural light and a cloakroom excellent storage.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:         Bright front-aspect sitting room with open fireplace and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining:      Fully fitted kitchen with free standing kitchen appliances & lino flooring.  \r\n\r\nLiving Room:         Located off the kitchen/dining area, with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nSunroom:\tDoor to rear garden.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C:              Wash hand basin & w.c.\r\n\r\nUpstairs: \r\nBedroom 1:\tFront-aspect main bedroom with built-in wardrobe and wash hand basin.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 2: \tRear-aspect bedroom with wash hand basin and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\tRear-aspect bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\tFront-aspect bedroom.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:  Bathroom with bath, W.C., wash hand basin and separate power shower. \r\n\r\nOutside:  A driveway provides ample off-street parking and leads directly to forecourt with attached garage, which offers excellent storage. To the rear, the property benefits from a large, private garden enclosed by mature hedging and established trees and planting. \r\n\r\nServices: \r\n•\tOil-fired central heating. Mains water. Sewage mains"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\t4-bedroom detached home.\r\n•\tBuilt in 1971.\r\n•\tLarge rear garden.\r\n•\tFront garden and driveway. \r\n•\tOil-fired central heating.\r\n•\tConvenient Carrigtwohill location.\r\n•\tBER: D\r\n•\tBER No: 119839454"
      },
